<!-- 4. What Problem Stayora Solves -->
<section class="problem-section">
    <div class="home-container">
        <div class="section-header-center">
            <span class="eyebrow-light">Real-Life Problems We Solve</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Booking a stay shouldn&rsquo;t feel like guesswork.</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">
                Everyday travelers and property owners run into the same frustrations on legacy platforms.
                Stayora is built to solve them directly.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="problem-grid">
            <div class="problem-card">
                <div class="problem-label">The Problem</div>
                <h3>Hidden fees at checkout</h3>
                <p>A stay that looks affordable upfront often jumps sharply once service and cleaning fees appear at the final step.</p>
                <div class="problem-divider"></div>
                <div class="solution-label">How Stayora Solves It</div>
                <p class="solution-text">Clear, transparent pricing from the very first glance , no last-minute surprises.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="problem-card">
                <div class="problem-label">The Problem</div>
                <h3>Unverified listings &amp; clutter</h3>
                <p>Scrolling through thousands of unvetted rooms makes it hard to trust whether a home matches its photos.</p>
                <div class="problem-divider"></div>
                <div class="solution-label">How Stayora Solves It</div>
                <p class="solution-text">Curated, verified homes reviewed for accuracy, safety essentials, and comfort.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="problem-card">
                <div class="problem-label">The Problem</div>
                <h3>Slow, disconnected support</h3>
                <p>Rigid middleman policies leave hosts under-supported and guests waiting when travel plans change.</p>
                <div class="problem-divider"></div>
                <div class="solution-label">How Stayora Solves It</div>
                <p class="solution-text">Direct host-to-guest messaging backed by responsive, human-first 24/7 support.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

